1
00:00:02,005 --> 00:00:04,050
Book nine is Leviathan Falls,

2
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:05,700
the end of the story.

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,865
Duarte has vanished from Laconia,

4
00:00:07,885 --> 00:00:11,110
changed by the protomolecule into something new.

5
00:00:11,245 --> 00:00:13,895
Teresa has fled with the Rocinante.

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,690
And the beings outside space

7
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,190
are striking back.

8
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:19,640
Four stories: the hunt for Duarte,

9
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,615
the Rocinante, Elvi's search for answers,

10
00:00:22,635 --> 00:00:24,065
and the last choice at the heart

11
00:00:24,085 --> 00:00:25,190
of the Ring.

12
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,527
Spoilers ahead!

13
00:00:27,281 --> 00:00:30,286
Story one: Colonel Aliana Tanaka,

14
00:00:30,306 --> 00:00:32,311
Laconia's best hunter.

15
00:00:32,331 --> 00:00:34,186
Her orders are to find Duarte

16
00:00:34,206 --> 00:00:35,636
and bring him home.

17
00:00:35,656 --> 00:00:37,436
She learns he escaped Laconia

18
00:00:37,456 --> 00:00:39,511
in an ancient alien ship.

19
00:00:39,531 --> 00:00:40,411
To find him,

20
00:00:40,431 --> 00:00:41,461
she decides to find

21
00:00:41,481 --> 00:00:43,611
the one person he would reach for:

22
00:00:43,631 --> 00:00:45,036
his daughter Teresa,

23
00:00:45,056 --> 00:00:47,706
who is now traveling with the Rocinante.

24
00:00:48,372 --> 00:00:52,297
Tanaka follows the Rocinante from system to system.

25
00:00:52,372 --> 00:00:55,102
But something strange is happening to her.

26
00:00:55,122 --> 00:00:57,052
Memories that aren't hers start drifting

27
00:00:57,072 --> 00:00:58,427
into her mind.

28
00:00:58,447 --> 00:00:59,642
She fights them off,

29
00:00:59,662 --> 00:01:01,092
and keeps going.

30
00:01:01,112 --> 00:01:02,142
The trail leads

31
00:01:02,162 --> 00:01:04,142
to the one place every gate connects

32
00:01:04,162 --> 00:01:06,117
to: the station at the center

33
00:01:06,137 --> 00:01:06,979
of the Ring.

34
00:01:07,708 --> 00:01:10,263
Story two: the Rocinante.

35
00:01:10,283 --> 00:01:12,263
Holden, Naomi, Alex,

36
00:01:12,283 --> 00:01:15,843
Amos, and Teresa run the underground from Freehold.

37
00:01:15,863 --> 00:01:18,843
Laconia's Admiral Trejo offers peace,

38
00:01:18,863 --> 00:01:21,668
but only if Teresa is handed back.

39
00:01:21,688 --> 00:01:24,668
A resistance captain named Jillian Houston locks

40
00:01:24,688 --> 00:01:27,318
the crew in their quarters and takes the deal.

41
00:01:27,338 --> 00:01:28,743
The crew breaks free,

42
00:01:28,763 --> 00:01:31,143
and the Gathering Storm sacrifices itself

43
00:01:31,163 --> 00:01:32,590
to cover their escape.

44
00:01:33,161 --> 00:01:35,216
Then a colony ship nearly vanishes

45
00:01:35,236 --> 00:01:35,916
in the gates,

46
00:01:35,936 --> 00:01:37,886
and something new happens.

47
00:01:37,976 --> 00:01:39,681
All across human space,

48
00:01:39,701 --> 00:01:42,456
people start sharing memories and thoughts.

49
00:01:42,476 --> 00:01:43,856
It's Duarte.

50
00:01:43,876 --> 00:01:45,631
His plan is to join all

51
00:01:45,651 --> 00:01:47,706
of humanity into one mind,

52
00:01:47,726 --> 00:01:48,881
strong enough to fight

53
00:01:48,901 --> 00:01:51,031
the beings outside space.

54
00:01:51,051 --> 00:01:53,022
And it's spreading like a virus.

55
00:01:53,751 --> 00:01:56,556
Story three: Elvi Okoye.

56
00:01:56,576 --> 00:01:57,631
Her team goes back

57
00:01:57,651 --> 00:01:59,756
to the giant diamond at Adro,

58
00:01:59,776 --> 00:02:01,506
the gate builders' record.

59
00:02:01,526 --> 00:02:02,836
With help from Cara,

60
00:02:02,856 --> 00:02:05,261
the girl the strange dogs changed,

61
00:02:05,281 --> 00:02:06,986
they finally read it.

62
00:02:07,006 --> 00:02:09,036
The builders were small sea creatures

63
00:02:09,056 --> 00:02:11,406
who joined their minds into one.

64
00:02:11,516 --> 00:02:12,846
And even as one mind,

65
00:02:12,866 --> 00:02:15,721
the beings outside space destroyed them.

66
00:02:16,412 --> 00:02:19,042
That is the warning Elvi brings back.

67
00:02:19,062 --> 00:02:21,167
Duarte is trying to turn humanity

68
00:02:21,187 --> 00:02:22,702
into the gate builders,

69
00:02:22,722 --> 00:02:24,702
and the gate builders lost.

70
00:02:24,722 --> 00:02:26,927
Elvi's dives into the alien record

71
00:02:26,947 --> 00:02:28,377
are dangerous for the people

72
00:02:28,397 --> 00:02:29,647
who make them.

73
00:02:29,712 --> 00:02:32,892
When the cost grows too high, she stops.

74
00:02:32,912 --> 00:02:35,633
Her answers point to the Ring Station, too.

75
00:02:36,352 --> 00:02:39,177
Story four: the heart of the Ring.

76
00:02:39,312 --> 00:02:40,762
To get inside the station,

77
00:02:40,782 --> 00:02:43,992
Holden injects himself with live protomolecule,

78
00:02:44,012 --> 00:02:47,042
and Miller's ghost returns to open the way.

79
00:02:47,062 --> 00:02:50,132
Holden, Teresa, and Tanaka find Duarte

80
00:02:50,152 --> 00:02:51,377
at the center.

81
00:02:51,537 --> 00:02:53,842
Teresa begs her father to stop.

82
00:02:53,862 --> 00:02:54,842
He won't.

83
00:02:54,862 --> 00:02:56,042
Tanaka kills him,

84
00:02:56,062 --> 00:02:57,690
and dies soon after.

85
00:02:58,376 --> 00:02:59,556
With Duarte gone,

86
00:02:59,576 --> 00:03:02,756
the beings outside space come for everyone.

87
00:03:02,776 --> 00:03:05,181
Holden takes Duarte's place in the station

88
00:03:05,201 --> 00:03:06,731
and holds them back.

89
00:03:06,751 --> 00:03:08,726
He learns the gates hurt the beings,

90
00:03:08,746 --> 00:03:10,426
which is why they fight.

91
00:03:10,446 --> 00:03:12,251
So he makes his choice.

92
00:03:12,271 --> 00:03:14,476
He refuses to force a single mind

93
00:03:14,496 --> 00:03:17,851
on humanity, and he shuts down every gate.

94
00:03:17,871 --> 00:03:20,737
The station, and Holden with it, is gone.

95
00:03:21,383 --> 00:03:22,413
The series ends

96
00:03:22,433 --> 00:03:24,448
with about thirteen hundred worlds,

97
00:03:24,468 --> 00:03:26,073
cut off from each other.

98
00:03:26,093 --> 00:03:28,873
Naomi, Amos, and Teresa head home

99
00:03:28,893 --> 00:03:30,593
to the solar system.

100
00:03:30,658 --> 00:03:32,163
Humanity will have to find

101
00:03:32,183 --> 00:03:34,558
its own way between the stars.

102
00:03:34,668 --> 00:03:35,023
And on one

103
00:03:35,043 --> 00:03:36,623
of those cut off worlds,

104
00:03:36,643 --> 00:03:39,048
Filip Nagata is starting over.

105
00:03:39,068 --> 00:03:41,020
Next up: his story.

